    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Halite Warriors vs. The Snail</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's called A Snail's Tale - that might lead you to believe that the snail is the main character, but nay, friend. The player takes control of Samson Spligglebarp, the noble descendant of a famed historian who is eager to make his own mark on the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samson travels to the Halite Kingdom to enter King Phillippe's challenge, competing against other adventurers for a chance to be a Halite Warrior. The King reveals that he is eternally pursued by an immortal snail who will never rest until he is destroyed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins the quest of Samson and his intrepid companions, the Halite Warriors, to gather the three Crystals of Power and stop the snail before he catches the King.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/2251b815cd32f82743f9c4010b340fdf.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0ce0a45838376132d6c2f6a66731f33c.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/10ce731543b723645208433937f009af.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/b71b4466ae4df78c08a5af3eb5b06e9a.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0274f07a45fb96c829fd805f7f6b1907.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/5cb6f5fda27433ab82f2fdb6648bbcb9.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A retro jRPG mixed with elements of cozy games. Strategic turn based combat is mixed with an idle quest system, minigames, and a world equal parts funny and mysterious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Class system with wacky choices such as the Codwalloper who attacks with dead fish, Souschef who cooks enemies to turn them into items, the survivalist Scrounger, a parlor magician Rinkydink, and an essential oils salesperson known as the Oilist. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include a day/night system, obligatory fishing minigame, two player local co-op in battles, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Halite Warriors vs. The Snail</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's called A Snail's Tale - that might lead you to believe that the snail is the main character, but nay, friend. The player takes control of Samson Spligglebarp, the noble descendant of a famed historian who is eager to make his own mark on the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samson travels to the Halite Kingdom to enter King Phillippe's challenge, competing against other adventurers for a chance to be a Halite Warrior. The King reveals that he is eternally pursued by an immortal snail who will never rest until he is destroyed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so begins the quest of Samson and his intrepid companions, the Halite Warriors, to gather the three Crystals of Power and stop the snail before he catches the King.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/2251b815cd32f82743f9c4010b340fdf.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0ce0a45838376132d6c2f6a66731f33c.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/10ce731543b723645208433937f009af.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/b71b4466ae4df78c08a5af3eb5b06e9a.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/0274f07a45fb96c829fd805f7f6b1907.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944770/extras/5cb6f5fda27433ab82f2fdb6648bbcb9.avif?t=1744766488\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A retro jRPG mixed with elements of cozy games. Strategic turn based combat is mixed with an idle quest system, minigames, and a world equal parts funny and mysterious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Class system with wacky choices such as the Codwalloper who attacks with dead fish, Souschef who cooks enemies to turn them into items, the survivalist Scrounger, a parlor magician Rinkydink, and an essential oils salesperson known as the Oilist. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include a day/night system, obligatory fishing minigame, two player local co-op in battles, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A retro jRPG with a twist. Have you heard the one about the million dollars and the immortal snail? A Snail's Tale will let you play out the story and answer the question once and for all - can he be stopped?",
